Z||000003||Tigger||07-30-2001||10:35 AM||||You're just looking to buy this car.  It can be fixed, but talking from experience, it's a pain.<P>Is it "just" a stress crack or have the mounting holes turned into slots?<P>The pass. LCA RR mount on my car had both...  The bolt was bent and rusted into the bushing sleeves, I had to cut the control arm (it was junk anyway) off the car to cut the bolts with a 4" cutting wheel on a die grinder.<P>Ohhh what fun that was.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">||||reg||1
